name: Inspect included scanner context, omissions and immutable lesson text before spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-picker
keys: Down Down p
require-live-snap: 20 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | inspection-needed
expect: press Enter
keys: p
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | inspected-copy
keys: Space
require-live-snap: 20 p Inspect scanner context | visible-preview-action
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 first 2048 | explicit-lesson-omission
expect-not: OMITTED_LESSON_TAIL
ask: Does the scanner view distinguish the included threat-model digest from the complete saved document and disclose the lesson text omitted before any model work?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-end-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: projection-hashes-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | projection-home-40x12
ask: Does the current projection remain named while reading at every size, with predictable paging and Home/End navigation?
resize: 120x36
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Complete selected context document | full-document
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | returned-projection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART inspected
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | returned-study
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restarted-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | restarted-context-picker
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | reread-copy
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 first 2048 | recovered-projection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart inspect the same immutable lesson/context and projection hash while preserving the active context, source and zero provider or discovery work?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
